wLUdKCsjZBkQ7kNvwHiJbtz&_nc_oc=Adp-sEgo-BoWpUrO6-krzjbYqsABXuux2OL_8S5xhxav6eHdBYER3iPvFu1VX_XXZGg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDg7oM8AmdrzdHEyNCEP4n8Bteaj9ysfqCi9GQE2z8mLg&oe=6A5CDBB7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nFs2q9sUit4Q7kNvwG7HSHQ&_nc_oc=AdpYepOBzVjWj6QJbdBKV7iWeWxoEj7KEl29jVifLHAwkCC5J2ifh3A62mzXSFvrpXk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCXW0bYArskjqmVx1lq-LC7kyhIWS84X7wKg87dnNsZGQ&oe=6A5CDD4A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h2d5jKZ9pC0Q7kNvwHuSf2P&_nc_oc=Adriv1UgqzTUPHtUNYcESxzhocFZy2j0F5wSXIK6gFwLXa285ucwcMCQK7yPg0C0WOU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCMvGTrI83pQAMsRnlSrgEFlw_G4O-HrTxuDsN683LrJQ&oe=6A5CCA6F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nJZHY0AkRsQQ7kNvwESvB8U&_nc_oc=AdqARLRSFNXjY24DcL57XJIvb6lHrYpmcKPGW3FrJW9Bq1fbEZYmlxqxYgE6MoXEAAw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBk1NanZhfB8i_mTRvfbdidWUpryhldlrvVoECIWPqr3A&oe=6A5CB3C3"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NtTqPWPZWSUQ7kNvwGCSOpa&_nc_oc=AdozEBQq8qLtyBmmsiJWMP9p4uHP6MlZwtfiUCwbv43C9x6LRGJxCqz0hf8ImzcL4TQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBAnUrnvwMxP1fJn-w_DUyprRGJy1GM6HBXq2yXeq3Sig&oe=6A5CE458"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gJWchPUdJ98Q7kNvwESBqMp&_nc_oc=AdqUVLTaDZAs7zCdVbCYJnWXzMpTyckRGsiSTiUQJqyLJjF-2J9TePmckQpDROTwZ_w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA5tRyJMX-1LtWsBoWm0fDlEb2j_3JsSOiJ4ym_bXsUdA&oe=6A5CBF3C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080